B.SQ=new A.af("FLYING","On desktop, fly with WASD or arrows; left-click empty playfield to BLAST, E for skill, Q for NOVA, and Escape to pause. Touch anywhere on the left half to place the joystick, then slide to fly. Release to hover. Fly left or right to turn; BLAST, FLAME and STORM fire in the direction you face. Use a second finger for attacks. Distance is your score. Collect coins and hearts; dodge flames, enemies, bullets, and warned lanes. BLAST overheats after four fast shots. Spell pilots have a SKILL button with a cooldown.")
