B.T4=new A.af("PILOTS & BOOSTS","Browse all five pilots in the Pilot Hangar; locked cards show both requirements. Sky Glider and Jetpack Ace have five hearts. Ember Mage, Storm Warden, and Rift Weaver have four. FLAME pierces three targets, STORM damages three targets and clears shots, and WEAVE slows eligible hostile projectiles within its moving cyan field for three seconds.")
B.T5=new A.af("REGIONS","The frontier begins at 10 km and changes every 5 km. Warnings lock where an attack will happen, so move after the warning. Guardians follow until defeated while distance and scenery continue. After 30 km the four frontier worlds repeat: Crystal Tempest \u2192 Clockwork Citadel \u2192 Eclipse Gardens \u2192 Astral Rift.")
B.T6=new A.af("BUILD A RUN","Every serviced checkpoint offers a free perk draft before its shop. Guardian combat defers the latest crossed visit until victory. \u201cPermanent\u201d in the shop means permanent for this run only. From 8 km, any pilot can buy SKY NOVA for 120 coins. NOVA clears visible ordinary enemies and hostile attacks, deals 8 guardian damage, and normally recharges in 45 seconds.")
